<Routine Name="AGC" Type="RLL">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Auto Gage Control Block]]>
</Description>
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 4 — ) Signal from AT to delcare a fault. Latch fault for elongation state. )]]>
</Description>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(M0257)ONS(OSR_M0717)OTE(M0717);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 5 — Set the internal bits for the AGC Force/Elongation Pushbuttons. Set the gage control mode based on the toggle state. The bit selections are: Mode bit 1 | 0 ------------------------------ Elongation 1 | 0 Force 1 | 1 Elongation and force can be selected only when the Mill Weld sequence is idle.]]>
</Description>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(M0717)XIC(M0708),XIC(M0718)]XIO(M0705)XIO(M0709)OTE(M0718);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Description>
