<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 21 — If Elongation or Force Mode is selected set the AGC Auto to AT. Default the AT mode to Elongation State. Do not process code while Mill Weld sequence is active.]]>
</Description>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(M0258)OTU(M0720);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
