<Rung Number="31" Type="N">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 41 — This is the Call to the Inc/Dec routine. the call takes place two different ways. The first is a oneshot of the service flag, which allows the value to inc or dec once correctly each time the request is given. The second way is based on a timer which is run by the service flag. This calls the routine at the same interval consistently.]]>
</Description>
