</Rung>
<Rung Number="43" Type="N">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 34 — 1 Tell the drive control system we want to autolevel. 2 When it says it is OK, pass the command to the screwdown board. The drive system acknowledge then acts as an enable signal.]]>
</Description>
