<Rung Number="48" Type="N">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 38 — This timer is used for all the watch dog timers in the auto level cycle. The preset value is set and the timer is reset by the sequence that needs the watchdog.]]>
</Description>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIO(WKRLVL0),XIC(T_SEC),XIC(LAMPTST)]XIC(WKRLVL5)OTE(Q0708);]]>
