<Routine Name="FAULTF" Type="RLL">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Fault Finder Control Block]]>
</Description>
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 4 — ) This is the beginning of the Fault Finder routine. Fault finder uses three basic groups of registers. They are Faults, First Faults, and Unacknowledge. Each group uses 12 registers. R01-12 [Faults] -- Contain the current status of each fault. R13-24 [1st Faults] -- First faults that have occurred for each screen. First faults are not used by status screens. R25-36 [Unacks] -- Unacknowledged faults. Whenever a fault occurs, it is ORed into this area. Cleared by the operator by using the F7 key on the AT computer. This does not apply to status screens. First six control bits determine the type of screen, Fault or Status. )]]>
</Description>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ALW_OFF)OTE(FFSTAT1);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 5]]>
</Description>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ALW_ON)OTE(FFSTAT2);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 6]]>
</Description>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ALW_ON)OTE(FFSTAT3);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 7]]>
</Description>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ALW_ON)OTE(FFSTAT4);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 8]]>
</Description>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ALW_ON)OTE(FFSTAT5);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 9 — FFACKA determines when all faults are acknowledged. This is typically from one or more of the following sources: - First PLC scan - Mill run one-shot auto acknowledge - An operator pushbutton Each screen is individually acknowledged by copying the AT data transfer area acknowledge bits to the fault finder's working bits.]]>
</Description>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ALW_OFF)OTE(FFSTAT6);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 11]]>
</Description>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(FST_SCN),XIC(M0488)]OTE(FFACKA);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 12 — Move the actual program fault bits to the logic manipulation area.]]>
</Description>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ALW_ON)COP(ATRSTAT,FFACK1,6);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 14 — Fault Finder Screen 1 Code]]>
</Description>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ALW_ON)COP(FFFB101,FFFB1LO,12);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
