<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 4 — ) This block is a sequential flow state logic to control the Mill Online and Offline functions. Cegelec controls the work roll drive. Signals are transmitted to and received from Cegelec. )]]>
</Description>
