<Routine Name="SETTIME" Type="RLL">
<Description>
<![CDATA[PLC Set Time Control Block]]>
</Description>
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 4 — ) Set the PLC time and date using the service request function 7. Set up registers with the data required by the function 7 service request. The parameters are setup to use the BCD format. A total of six registers are used: %R181 = 1 to SET PLC %R182 = 1 for BCD format %R183 = Lo Byte = Year, Hi Byte = Month %R184 = Lo Byte = Day of Month, Hi Byte = Hours %R185 = Lo Byte = Minutes, Hi Byte = Seconds %R186 = Lo Byte = Day of Week, Hi Byte = Null ) Call the service request to set the time and date.]]>
</Description>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ALW_ON)MOV(1,R00181);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 4 — ) Set the PLC time and date using the service request function 7. Set up registers with the data required by the function 7 service request. The parameters are setup to use the BCD format. A total of six registers are used: %R181 = 1 to SET PLC %R182 = 1 for BCD format %R183 = Lo Byte = Year, Hi Byte = Month %R184 = Lo Byte = Day of Month, Hi Byte = Hours %R185 = Lo Byte = Minutes, Hi Byte = Seconds %R186 = Lo Byte = Day of Week, Hi Byte = Null ) Call the service request to set the time and date.]]>
</Description>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ALW_ON)MOV(1,R00182);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 4 — ) Set the PLC time and date using the service request function 7. Set up registers with the data required by the function 7 service request. The parameters are setup to use the BCD format. A total of six registers are used: %R181 = 1 to SET PLC %R182 = 1 for BCD format %R183 = Lo Byte = Year, Hi Byte = Month %R184 = Lo Byte = Day of Month, Hi Byte = Hours %R185 = Lo Byte = Minutes, Hi Byte = Seconds %R186 = Lo Byte = Day of Week, Hi Byte = Null ) Call the service request to set the time and date.]]>
</Description>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ALW_ON)COP(R00182,R00183,4);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GE Rung 6]]>
</Description>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ALW_ON)NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
